\r\n  On the way visit Matale Spice Garden\r\n\r\n  Check In at the Hotel\r\n\r\n  Diner and Overnight stay at the hotel- Hotel\r\n\r\n*******************************************************************\r\n\r\n Day 03: Kandy – Nuwara Eliya \r\n\r\n  Breakfast at the Hotel and En-route to Nuwara Eliya \r\n\r\n  Visit the Temple of the Tooth Relic - (USD 8 PP)\r\n\r\n  Explore at the Gem Gallery and also Experience a Kandy Dance \r\n\r\n  Check In at the HotelVisit the famous Kandy Botanical Garden. Here you can see a beautiful collection of orchids and spectacular views of surrounding - \r\n  (USD 10 PP)\r\n\r\n  Upon your arrival in Nuwara Eliya, you will explore the picturesque beauty of this little England of Srilanka. Here you will witness fancy houses, \r\n  fences, and hedges influenced by British architecture\r\n\r\n  Check In at the Hotel\r\n\r\n  Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel – Hotel\r\n\r\n******************************************************************\r\n\r\n Day 04: Nuwara Eliya (STAY)\r\n\r\n  Breakfast at the Hotel and En-route to Nuwara Eliya \r\n\r\n  Visit the Horton Plains – Optional (USD 55 PP) or relax and full day leisure at Hotel\r\n\r\n  Visit the Kadugannawa Tea Factory\r\n\r\n  Do a Nuwara Eliya City Tour \r\n\r\n  Visit Ramboda Falls along with Hanumanji Temple\r\n\r\n  Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel – Hotel\r\n\r\n******************************************************************\r\n\r\n Day 05: Nuwara Eliya – South Beach \r\n\r\n  Early check-out and Breakfast at the hotel and drive to Down south  \r\n\r\n  You will be taken a Boat ride at the Madhu River Boat Safari - (USD 5 PP – Min. 3 Pax)\r\n\r\n  Visit the famous Turtle Hatchery at Kosgoda. Here you can observe the largest five species of turtles being taken care of in the tanks- (USD 5 PP)\r\n\r\n  Check-in to hotel and relax – Hotel\r\n\r\n  Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel- Hotel\r\n\r\n*******************************************************************\r\n\r\n Day 06: South Beach (STAY)\r\n\r\n  Breakfast at the hotel\r\n\r\n  Experience Whale Watching - (USD 110 PP)\r\n\r\n  You will be taken to Yala National Park which is one of the largest Wild Life Sites - (USD 165 PP)\r\n\r\n  One of the above Site Seeing’s\r\n\r\n  Check-in to hotel – Hotel\r\n\r\n  Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel – Hotel\r\n\r\n*******************************************************************\r\n\r\n Day 07: South Beach - Colombo\r\n\r\n  Breakfast at the hotel\r\n\r\n  Proceed to Colombo City Tour & Shopping \r\n\r\n  Check-in to hotel – Hotel\r\n\r\n  Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel \r\n\r\n City Tour: While on your city tour in Colombo you may visit famous places including Galle Face Green, the Viharamahadevi Park, National Museum, Twin \r\n World Trade Center towers, Old Parliament Building, Fort district, Independence Hall at Independence Square, and prominent Buddhist, Hindu, Islam and \r\n Christian places of worship. (Entrance fees to sites not included). \r\n\r\n*******************************************************************\r\n\r\n Day 08: Colombo – Airport\r\n\r\n  Breakfast at the hotel \r\n\r\n  Proceed to Colombo City Tour & Shopping\r\n \r\n  Checkout from the hotel \r\n\r\n  Proceed to Airport for Departure \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','',', Accommodation at the hotels mentioned or similar with on HB basis.\r\n\r\n Transportation in a Pvt air conditioned vehicle as mentioned above \r\n\r\n English speaking chauffeur\r\n \r\n GST 5% \r\n\r\n Per Day Per Person 1 water bottles – 500 ML\r\n\r\n Government Tax (VAT 15%).\r\n\r\n Toll charges.\r\n',', \r\n Tips to Chauffeurs\r\n\r\n Visa fees USD 25 PP (https://eta.gov.lk/slvisa/)\r\n\r\n PCR Test Charges USD 40 PP\r\n\r\n Covid 19 Insurance Coverage \r\n\r\n Guide Fees\r\n\r\n Optional Excursions\r\n\r\n  SIM Cards \r\n\r\n  Any fluctuations in the dollar component will affect th