fe fees & Red Cross fee\r\n* Environmental fee\r\n* Ladakh Entry Fee\r\n* Inner line permit Nubra Valley & Pangong lake\r\n* Toll taxes/Parking/Driver allowances','THE ABOVE PACKAGE COST DOES NOT INCLUDE:-\r\n* Any Kind of Personal Expenses or Optional Tours / Extra Meals Ordered\r\n* Anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”.\r\n* The Services of Vehicle is not included on leisure days & after finishing the sightseeing tour as per the Itinerary\r\n* Guide fee, Camera fee & any monument Entrances\r\n* Medical & Travel insurance\r\n* Any changes you may choose to make during your tour\r\n* Additional costs due to flight cancellation, road blocks et',' \r\nIMPORTANT NOTE:\r\nRooms in hotels/Camps are subject to availability       \r\nQuote is based upon base category of rooms in hotels and camps unless specified\r\nGiven rates are valid for Indian nationals only\r\n ','2022-06-02','2022-06-07',0,0,0,'2022-05-27 15:17:39','2022-05-27 15:17:39'),(88,307,15510,2,2,0,140700,28200,'Amazing Thailand','10  Night 11 Days Pattaya , Bangkok Tour Package\r\n\r\nNumber of Pax: 2 Adults , 2 Child\r\n\r\nNationality: Indian\r\n\r\nNumber of Room: 1 Double & 01 Extra Bed Room\r\n\r\nArrival Date: 18 June 2022\r\n\r\nDeparture Date: 28 June 2022\r\n\r\nA-One The Royal Cruise Hotel Family Room +The Berkeley Hotel Pratunam Quad Roomn','','05 Nights accommodation with ABF Pattaya at above mention Hotel \r\n\r\n05 Nights accommodation with ABF Bangkok at above mention Hotel\r\n\r\n\r\nSvn apt pty htl bkk htl svn apt transfers pvt.\r\n\r\nCoral Island tour sic\r\n\r\nUnderwater world pvt.\r\n\r\nAlcazar show normal seat pvt.\r\n\r\nH/d bkk city tour sic\r\n\r\nSafariworld tours sic\r\n\r\nChaophraya dinner cruise sic\r\n\r\nSiam perk tour with lunch sic\r\n','Anything which is not included in inclusions','','2022-06-18','2022-06-28',0,0,0,'2022-05-27 17:37:25','2022-05-27 18:05:12'),(89,302,16225,6,5,0,50000,3000,'Mesmerizing Dalhousie','Stay Duration: 3N/4D\r\nTravel Plan: Delhi - Dalhousie - Delhi\r\nTransport Mode: By Road in a 12-seater tempo traveler\r\n\r\n\r\nItinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Delhi - Dalhousie\r\nAs you reach Dalhousie, check-in at a hotel and relax. The rest of the day is to be spent at leisure. The town is built around five hills topped with snow and covered with lush greenery. Dalhousie is prettified with the existence of flawless art, colorful temples, handicrafts, and ancient Hindu culture. Overnight stay in hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Local Sightseeing in Dalhousie\r\nAfter breakfast, proceed to explore this picturesque town. You start your Dalhousie sightseeing with Panchpula; adorned with natural water pools and a monument built in the memory of Sardar Ajit Singh (Freedom fighter), Panchpula can be listed as one of the topmost attractions of Dalhousie.  Afterward, offer sincere prayers in a popular temple of Dalhousie; Bhulwani Mata Mandir at Bara Pathar. Have dinner and stay overnight in the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Dalhousie - Khajjiar - Dalhousie\r\nAfter breakfast, proceed to Khajjiar - The Mini Switzerland of India. This name has officially been given to Khajjiar because its landscape looks similar to that of Switzerland. In the middle of the foothills is the picturesque Khajjiar Lake, tranquil and serene. Return back to Dalhousie, have dinner, and enjoy the overnight stay in the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Dalhousie - Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast, process the check-out at the hotel. And then proceed to Delhi.\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 3 nights accommodation in Dalhousie\r\n* 3 breakfasts\r\n* Delhi-Dalhousie-Delhi by road transfers\r\n* Local Sightseeing in Dalhousie\r\n','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions. ','','2022-06-23','2022-06-26',0,0,0,'2022-05-28 13:45:53','2022-05-28 13:48:21'),(90,312,3511,3,0,0,62300,16000,'Amazing North East','Travel Date -  10TH JUNE 2022\r\n\r\n(5 Nights / 6 Days)\r\n\r\n(Gangtok 3N - Darjeeling 2N) \r\n\r\nNo of Pax : 3\r\n\r\nNationality : Indian\r\n\r\nDay 01:IXB Airport - Gangtok (128 Kms. / 5 Hrs)\r\n\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\n\r\nDay 02: Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. / 3 Hrs. one-way)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\n\r\nNote: \r\n\r\n•Documents for Tsomgo Lake & New Baba Mandir – 02 Passport Size Photo along with Photo Copy of Photo ID Proof (Passport or Driving License or Voter ID (Pan Card & Adhaar Card is not accepted). For Children below 18 years, Birth Certificate / School Id / College Id are must. Original needs to carry while travelling. \r\n\r\n•In case of Land slide or any other reason, if Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provide alternate sightseeing.\r\n\r\nDay 03: Gangtok Full Day Local Sightseeing\r\n\r\nStart for a Full day city tour covering Tashi view point, Ganesh Tok, Hanuman Tok, Flower show, Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre (Closed on Sunday and 1st and 3rd Saturday of the month), Institute of Tibetology (Closed on Sunday), Dro-dul Chorten, Gonjang Monastery and Bakthang Falls (maximum 6 hours). Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\n\r\nDay 04: Gangtok - Darjeeling (100 Kms. / 4 Hrs.)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\nDay 05: Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\r\n\r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit / Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\nDay 06: Darjeeling - NJP Rly Station / IXB Airport (75 Kms. / 3 Hrs.)\r\nAfter breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to New Jalpaiguri Railway Station / Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n','','•Return Airfare\r\n\r\n•Accommodation on twin/double sharing basis.\r\n \r\n•All the room are base category\r\n \r\n•Meal Plan (as per mentioned above)\r\n\r\n•Exclusive Non a/c vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. Please brief to guest that vehicle will not be \r\n at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis).\r\n \r\n•All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary).\r\n\r\n•Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.\r\n\r\n•GST Included.\r\n','•Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage.\r\n\r\n•Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary.\r\n \r\n•Entrance Fees & Guide charges.\r\n \r\n•Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot).\r\n \r\n•Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure. \r\n\r\n•Room Heater Charges\r\n\r\n•Insurance. \r\n\r\n•Anything which is not included in the inclusion\r\n','Supplement cost :\r\n\r\n Nathula pass (Monday & Tuesday closed): Rs.6500.00 per car It can be done on the same day with Tsomgo Lake – Baba Mandir.\r\n\r\n Toy Train  Joy Ride (Darjeeling) : Rs.1800/- (Ticket Price + Service charge + GST) Per Person on the day of  Darjeeling local sightseeing + Rs.1500/- per vehicle car halting charges. \r\n\r\n We provide exclusive vehicles in our packages.\r\n Non a/c Wagon-R for 1-3 Pax including child.\r\n\r\n','2022-06-24','2022-06-29',1,0,0,'2022-05-31 20:02:06','2022-05-31 20:02:06'),(91,316,15526,2,0,0,70000,12000,'The Heaven on Earth','No. of Pax: 2\r\nMeal Plan: MAP\r\n\r\n02N Srinagar Grand Mamta\r\n01N Pahalgam Eden Resort\r\n01N Gulmarg Pine Spring\r\n01N Houseboat Jewel of the crown (Srinagar)\r\nShikara ride\r\n\r\n\r\n','','✔ Accommodation on twin/double/triple sharing basis\r\n✔ Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n✔ Airport/station pick-up and drop facility as confirmed by the travelers.\r\n✔ Sightseeing by non-AC Swift Dzire/Etios/Tavera/Innova Tempo as per the package selected.\r\n✔ Cost of Shikara Ride.\r\n✔ Driver Allowances.\r\n✔ Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n✔ Hotel Taxes','✔ Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\n✔ Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n✔ Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”.\r\n✔ Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n✔ Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n✔ Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n✔Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n✔ Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\n✔ Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\n✔ The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.','','2022-08-02','2022-08-07',0,0,0,'2022-06-03 14:34:25','2022-06-03 14:34:25'),(92,317,15534,2,0,0,84000,13000,'Leh-Ladakh','No. of Pax: 2\r\nMeal Plan: MAPI\r\nTravel Plan: 2N Leh - 1N Nubra Valley - 1N Pangong Lake - 1N Leh\r\n\r\n\r\n','','Assistance upon arrival at Leh Hotel\r\nTraditional welcome in t