 PVT Transfer\r\n','Anything which is not included in inclusions.','','2023-01-05','2023-01-12',1,0,0,'2022-09-17 17:50:03','2022-09-17 17:50:03'),(165,480,15518,2,0,0,113000,12000,'Amazing Kerala','Trip Duration: 7 Nights/ 8 Days\r\n\r\n3N Wayanad and 4N Munnar\r\n\r\nDay 01 – Calicut – Wayanadu - Pick up From Calicut and transfer to Wayanadu. Check in at resort. On the way visit Lakkidi View Point - it is the gateway of Wayanad as it is located at the crest of the serpentine Thamarassery ghat pass. There are nine hairpin curves. Evening proceed to visit Pookote Lake - Which is a natural fresh water lake nestling amid evergreen forests and mountain slopes at an altitude of 770 meters above sea level. Dinner and overnight stay at Wayanadu\r\n \r\nDay 02 – Wayanadu - After breakfast proceed for sightseeing to Kuruva Island these are small island located on tributeris of river kabani - Tholpetty Wildlife Sanctuary is one of the best places in Kerala for sighting wild elephants. Other than elephant herds, there is good chance to spot bison, deer, monkey, giant squirrel and a range of other animals.Tigers and leopards are present here. Thirunalli Temple Temple is the only temple in the world where the devotees can perform all the rituals related to one’s life, starting from birth to death and life after death. It is one of the most ancient temples in Kerala. It is believed that here the prathishta of Lord Vishnu was performed by Lord Brahma. It is also known as \'\'Sahyamala Kshetram\'\' and \'\'Kashi of the South\'\'.\r\n \r\nDay 03 – Wayanadu - After fresh up and breakfast proceed to visit Chembra Peak- is the highest peak in Wayanad, A heart shaped lake on the way to the top of the peak is a major tourist attraction, trucking is about 4 km. Next Moving to Soochippara Water falls which is a three-tiered waterfall surrounded by Deciduous, Evergreen and Montane forests. Locally referred to as Soochipara (\"Soochi\" meaning \"Needle\" and \"Para\" meaning \"Rock\"). Also visit Banasura Dam during your stay. Evening back to homestay dinner and overnight stay.\r\n \r\nDay 04 – Wayanadu - Munnar - After breakfast check out frpm the hotel and transfer to Munnar. Munnar is 1800 mts above sea level and also the place of South India\'s highest peak (Anamudi-2695 mts). On the way visit Valara, Cheeyappara waterfalls & Tea Plantations. On arrival at Munnar transfer to Hotel. Overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n \r\nDay 05 - Munnar\r\nAfter breakfast proceed to visit Rajamala (Eravikulam National Park - open as per the directions by the forest authorities ), the best place to see Nilgiri Tahr (Hermitragus Hilarious)- the mountain goat of South India & Tea Musium.  Evening have a short visit at Munnar town. You can see the beautiful tea estates like a green paradise. Overnight stay at Munnar\r\n \r\nDay - 06- Munnar\r\nAfter breakfast proceed for sightseeing. Maduppatty dam ,Echo Point, Kundalay Dam,Pothenmedu View Point, Blossom Park etc are some of the highlights of the sightseeing. Shopping & overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n \r\nDay - 07- Munnar\r\nRelax at the resort or proceed for local sightseeing. Dinner and overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n \r\nDay - 08- Munnar – Cochin \r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and drop at Cochin Airport for departure.','','* Flights for Delhi-Calicut and Kochi-Delhi\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\n* Accommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\n* All Transfers and sight seeing By Ac Toyota Etios/Swift Dzire Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 \r\n  AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions','','2022-12-13','2022-12-20',1,0,0,'2022-09-18 16:49:16','2022-09-18 16:49:16'),(166,481,349,6,3,0,964120,136000,'Mesmerizing Dubai','3N Abu Dhabhi and 6N/9N Dubai\r\n\r\n','','\r\n* Accommodation\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Two  way Airport transfer\r\n* Inter Hotel transfer\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner\r\n* Dhow cruise dinner\r\n* City tour\r\n* Abu Dhabi Ferrari world ticket and transfer\r\n* Burj Khalifa 124th floor ticket and transfer NPT\r\n* Future of museum ticket and transfer\r\n* Ain Dubai ticket and transfer\r\n* Global Village\r\n* Miracle Garden\r\n* Aqua venture and lost chamber\r\n* Bollywood theme park\r\n* Dolphin show ticket and transfer\r\n* Vat\r\n* All tour and transfer on pvt basis','Anything that is not included in Inclusions','','2022-12-25','2023-01-03',0,0,0,'2022-09-19 18:15:54','2022-09-19 20:33:40'),(167,482,628,4,2,0,42000,5000,'Chandigarh-Amritsar-Delhi','2N Chandigarh - 2N Amritsar - 1N Patiala\r\n\r\nChandigarh – Amritsar – Patiala Itinerary\r\n\r\nDay1: Pick up from Airport and drop at hotel\r\nAfter check-in, visit to Sector 17 Market. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay2: Chandigarh Local\r\nPost breakfast, visit to Rose Garden, Rock Garden, Sukhna Lake. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay3: Chandigarh – Amritsar\r\nPost breakfast, depart for Amritsar. After reaching Amritsar, check-in at the hotel. And visit to local market, Golden Temple, and Jallianwala Bagh. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay4: Wagah Border\r\nAfter breakfast, Visit the wagah border and then Gobindgarh Fort/ Saada Pind. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay5: Amritsar - Patiala\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel and leave for Patiala. After reaching check-in at the hotel. Then visit to Gurudwara Dukhniwaran Sahib. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay6: Local Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and proceed for Adalat Bazar, National Institute of Sports and Thapar University. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay7: Patiala - Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and depart for Delhi with beautiful memories. \r\n','','* Pick-up from Chandigarh Airport\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Chandigarh\r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Amritsar\r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Patiala\r\n* All sightseeing and transfers by an AC vehicle (Ertiga/Innova whichever will be available)\r\n* Transfer from Patiala to Delhi\r\n* All taxes for mentioned accommodation and meal plan\r\n* Toll Taxes','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions','','2022-10-15','2022-10-22',0,0,0,'2022-09-20 17:01:43','2022-09-22 12:10:51'),(168,483,349,6,3,0,558600,90000,'Mesmerizing Dubai','3N Abu Dhabhi and 6N/9N Dubai\r\n\r\n','','* 9/11 Nights Accommodation as per above with breakfast basis\r\n* Abu Dhabi Airport – Abu Dhabi Hotel\r\n* Abu Dhabi Hotel – Dubai Hotel\r\n* Dubai Hotel – Dubai Airport\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner\r\n* Dhow cruise creek with Dinner\r\n* Dubai half-day city tour\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor nonprime time\r\n* Dubai frame\r\n* Global village + miracle garden combo\r\n* Ferrari world only tickets\r\n ','Anything that is not included in Inclusions','','2022-12-25','2023-01-06',0,0,0,'2022-09-21 18:40:48','2022-09-21 19:00:49'),(169,484,15510,4,2,0,146000,25000,'Thailand','Date of Travel: 05 Jan 22\r\n\r\nNo of Pax: 04 Adult + 02 Chd (05 ,02 )\r\n\r\nNo of Room: 02 Double + 01 Child without bed\r\n\r\nMeal: CP\r\n','','Return airfare\r\n\r\nEvening Chaopraya Princess Dinner Cruise - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nSealife + Madam Tussauds BKK - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nMahanakhon Sky Walk  - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nFull Day Safari World + Marine Park with Lunch -SIC Transfer\r\n\r\nFull Day Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat with Local Lunch on SIC (Excl. National Marine Park Fee THB 400 PP)\r\n\r\nPhuket Fantasea Show with Transfers (Show + Dinner - Normal Seat) -SIC Transfer\r\n\r\nBKK APT - BKK HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nBKK HTL - BKK APT - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nKrabi APT - Krabi HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nKrabi HTL - Phuket HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nPhuket HTL - Phuket APT - PVT Transfer\r\n \r\n','Anything which is not included in inclusions.','','2023-01-05','2023-01-12',1,0,0,'2022-09-22 11:38:50','2022-09-23 12:46:29'),(170,485,349,6,3,0,0,0,'Mesmerizing Dubai','3N Abu Dhabhi and 6N/9N Dubai\r\n\r\n','','* 09/11 Nights Accommodation as per above with breakfast basis\r\n* Abu Dhabi Airport – Abu Dhabi Hotel\r\n* Abu Dhabi Hotel – Dubai Hotel\r\n* Dubai Hotel – Dubai Airport\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner\r\n* Dhow cruise creek with Dinner\r\n* Dubai half-day city tour\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non-prime time\r\n* Dubai Frame\r\n* Global village + miracle garden combo\r\n* Aquaventure and lost chambers\r\n* Bollywood theme park\r\n* Dolphin show\r\n* Future Museum\r\n* Ferrari World-only tickets\r\n* All Tours and transfers on a Pvt basis\r\n ,09/11 Nights Accommodation as per above with breakfast basis\r\nAbu Dhabi Airport – Abu Dhabi Hotel\r\nAbu Dhabi Hotel – Dubai Hotel\r\nDubai Hotel – Dubai Airport\r\nDesert safari with bbq dinner\r\nDhow cruise creek with Dinner\r\nDubai half-day city tour\r\nBurj khalifa 124 floor non-prime time\r\nDubai Frame\r\nGlobal village + miracle garden combo\r\nAquaventure and lost chambers\r\nBollywood theme park\r\nDolphin show\r\nFuture Museum\r\nFerrari World-only tickets\r\nAll Tours and transfers on a Pvt basis','Anything that is not included in Inclusions','','2022-12-25','2023-01-06',0,0,0,'2022-09-22 17:54:50','2022-09-22 18:57:59'),(172,367,15518,2,0,0,5600,2100,'Amazing Kerala','Wow Amazing','void packaGE','everytihng','everything','NOTHING REMARKS','2022-10-18','2022-10-31',0,0,0,'2022-10-17 20:50:35','2022-10-17 20:50:35'),(173,179,15518,2,4,3,83500,12000,'Great Kerala','8N/9D Tour of Kerala\r\n\r\n2N Kovalam - 1N Alleppey - 1N Thekkady - 2N Munnar - 1N Kochi - 1N Calicut\r\n\r\nDay 1: Trivandrum Arrival to Kovalam\r\nArrival Transfer - Trivandrum - Kovalam Arrival\r\nCheck-in at Hotel. Overnight stay at Kovalam.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2: Kovalam Sightseeing\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Kovalam – Trivandrum – Kovalam\r\nMorning after breakfast proceed for Sightseeing. Visit Padmanabha Swami Temple, Kuthiramalika\r\nPalace Museum, Zoo, Napier Museum & Veli Tourist Village. Overnight stay at Kovalam.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 3: Kovalam to Alleppey\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel\r\nTransfers - Kovalam to Alleppey\r\nVisit Alleppey beach, sunset and enjoy shopping if staying in Alleppey. Visit Alleppey Beach and Backwaters. Enjoy all the amenities of this hotel/resort for a day which includes fishing in the backwaters (depending on the hotel/resort selected). Overnight stay at the hotel/resort\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4: Alleppey - Thekkady\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel\r\nTransfers - Alleppey - Thekkady\r\nThekkady is a world-famous wildlife sanctuary. On arrival check-in at Hotel. In the Afternoon,\r\nvisit the wildlife sanctuary & enjoy the boating (tickets charges are extra and subject to availability). Visit spice plantations. The evening will be free for the Cultural show\r\n(Kathakali & Kalaripayattu on direct payment) & local shopping. Overnight Stay at Hotel.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5: Thekady to Munnar\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel\r\nTransfers - Thekkady to Munnar\r\nOn the way visit Valara, Cheeyappara waterfalls & Tea Plantations. Check-in at the Hotel. Afternoon visit Rajamala, the best place to see Nilgiri Tahr (Hermitragus Hilarious) - the mountain goat of South India & Tea Museum. In the evening, have a short visit to Munnar town. You can see the\r\nbeautiful tea estates like a green paradise. Overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6: Munnar Sightseeing DAY 02\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Munnar Sightseeing DAY 02\r\nMorning after breakfast proceed to enjoy a full day sightseeing tour of Munnar. Rose Garden, Tea Garden, Photo Point, Madupetty Dam/Lake, Echo Point & Kundala Dam/Lake. Overnight stay at hotel/resort.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 7: Munnar to Cochin\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel -\r\nTransfers - Munnar to Cochin\r\nCheck in at the hotel. Proceed for Cochin sightseeing. Visit the Dutch Palace. Jewish Synagogue - built in 1568 and the oldest Synagogue in the Commonwealth are at Mattancherry. St. Francis Church - built in 1510 and the oldest European church in India, Chinese Fishing Nets- introduced by the court of Kublai Khan can be seen in Fort Cochin. Fort Cochin Beach etc. Overnight stay at Cochin\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 8: Cochin - Calicut\r\nMorning after breakfast check out and proceed to Calicut. The central Kozhikode/Calicut Beach, overlooked by an old lighthouse, is a popular spot for watching the sunset. Inland, tree-lined Mananchira Square, with its musical fountain, surrounds the massive Mananchira Tank, an artificial pond. The Stone Memorial for Vasco de Gama stands tall in honor of the Portuguese explorer who\r\nlanded on Indian soil. Overnight stay at hotel/resort.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 9: Pick-up from the venue (mentioned by the client) followed by visit to Baypore Beach, Kappad beach, Kozhikode beach, Mittayi Theruvu, Krishna Menon art gallery and museum. Drop at Calicut Airport. (The calicut sightseeing can be done as per time availability)','','Inclusions\r\n1. Delhi to Trivandrum and Calicut to Delhi Airfare\r\n2. 7 Nights stay in above-mentioned hotels/resorts.\r\n3. Extra bed is also included in all properties\r\n4. Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary (Breakfast and Dinner)\r\n5. All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n6. All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost included.\r\n7. Etios car will be available for excursions.','Anything that is not mentioned in the inclusions.','','2022-11-26','2022-12-04',1,0,0,'2022-11-19 16:31:18','2022-11-21 22:41:46'),(174,179,349,8,7,6,50000,20000,'Amazing  Dubai','Dubai Exclusive 5 N 6 D. ','Non Refundable\r\n\r\n100%','Accomodation\r\nSight Seeing\r\nTransfers\r\nVisa\r\nFlights','Dhram Tax\r\nOTB\r\nTCS','Client must know. \r\n\r\n\r\nWhat is the deal \r\n\r\n\r\nRemarks matters.','2022-11-15','2022-11-25',0,1,0,'2022-11-21 22:43:45','2022-11-21 22:43:45'),(177,490,54,3,1,0,50000,5000,'04 NIGHTS 05 DAYS SINGAPORE PACKAGE ','04 NIGHTS 05 DAYS SINGAPORE PACKAGE ','','RETURN AIRPORT TRANSFERS ON PVT \r\n04 NIGHTS ACCOMODFATION AT MENTIONED HOTEL WITH BREAKFAST BASIS \r\nSINGAPORE HALF DAY CITY TOUR  ON SIC \r\nNIGHT SAFARI ON SIC \r\nUNIVERSAL STUDIOS ON SIC \r\nSENTOSA ISLAND TOUR -Cable Car Sky pass - One Way + Madame Tussauds\r\n& Images Of Singapore + Ultimate Star Experience + 4D Marvel + \r\nBoat ride + Wings Of Time (07.30 Pm) on sic \r\nRETURN AIR FARE \r\nHOTEL 04 NIGHTS WITH 02 ROOMS \r\nSINGAPORE TOURIST VISA \r\nGST Extra\r\n','•  All those which are not mentioned above \r\n•  Visa charges \r\n•  Travel insurance \r\n•  Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces \r\n•  Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc \r\n•  All Items Of Personal Nature \r\n•  Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc \r\n•  Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport \r\n•  Ayurveda Charges \r\n•  Only Non Ac Rooms Are Provided In Munnar And Thekkady As They Are Hill Stations \r\n•  Mandatory X- Mas / New Year Eve Supplementary Charges , That Should Be Paid By The Guest Directly \r\nTo The Hotels Concerned. \r\n','','2022-10-20','2022-10-24',1,0,0,'2023-02-27 11:24:47','2023-02-27 11:24:47'),(178,490,15518,2,0,0,5600,2100,'Amazing Kerala','Wow Amazing','void packaGE','everytihng','everything','NOTHING REMARKS','2022-10-18','2022-10-31',0,0,0,'2023-02-27 11:24:47','2023-02-27 11:24:47');
